  "ID": "46899",
  "post_title": "Intercambio de bandas de música en la recta final de la III Semana Cultural de Onda",
  "post_date": "2014-05-18 12:10:15",
  "post_name": "intercambio-de-bandas-de-musica-en-la-recta-final-de-la-iii-semana-cultural-de-onda",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Noticias|Política",
  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">El auditorio de la Uni&oacute;n Musical Santa Cecilia de Onda ha sido escenario la tarde-noche de este s&aacute;bado, 17 de mayo, del intercambio de la banda de m&uacute;sica titular con la de Soneja, en la recta final de la III Semana Cultural, que acaba este domingo con Sole Gim&eacute;nez acompa&ntilde;ada de la Onda Big Band.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/05/IMG_0610.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Dirigida por Juan Francisco Plasencia Civera, la banda sinf&oacute;nica de la Uni&oacute;n Musical de Soneja ha interpretado el pasodoble Los dos Adolfos, de Jos&eacute; Mar&iacute;a Mart&iacute;n, Lord Tullamore, de Wittrock, y Spartacus, de Van der Roost.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/05/IMG_0657.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">La banda sinf&oacute;nica de la Uni&oacute;n Musical Santa Cecilia de Onda &nbsp;ha sido dirigida por su titular, Daniel G&oacute;mez Asensio, para interpretar el pasodoble La Primitiva, de Penders, Ross Roy, de De Haan, y With heart and voice, de Gillingham.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/05/IMG_0656.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">En esta &uacute;ltima pieza ha intervenido como solista al piano Pablo Alarma Pi&ntilde;&oacute;n.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadabandessonejaondasetmanacultural14/img_0588.jpg\" alt=\"img_0588\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadabandessonejaondasetmanacultural14/img_0589.jpg\" alt=\"img_0589\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadabandessonejaondasetmanacultural14/img_0590.jpg\" alt=\"img_0590\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadabandessonejaondasetmanacultural14/img_0591.jpg\" alt=\"img_0591\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadabandessonejaondasetmanacultural14/img_0592.jpg\" alt=\"img_0592\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadabandessonejaondasetmanacultural14/img_0594.jpg\" alt=\"img_0594\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadabandessonejaondasetmanacultural14/img_0597.jpg\" alt=\"img_0597\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadabandessonejaondasetmanacultural14/img_0598.jpg\" alt=\"img_0598\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadabandessonejaondasetmanacultural14/img_0599.jpg\" alt=\"img_0599\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadabandessonejaondasetmanacultural14/img_0606.jpg\" alt=\"img_0606\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src